   "lv": "kolay",
   "q": "<p>Aşağıdaki olasılık doğrusu 0 ile 1 arasında eş aralıklara bölünmüş ve üzerinde K, L, M, N ve P noktaları işaretlenmiştir.</p><div class=\"fig\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 580 104\" width=\"560\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Olasılık doğrusu: 0 ile 1 arası 20 eş aralığa bölünmüş. K noktası 0’da, L noktası 8. çizgide, M noktası 12. çizgide, N noktası 15. çizgide, P noktası 1’de.\"><line x1=\"40\" y1=\"62\" x2=\"540\" y2=\"62\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"/><line x1=\"40\" y1=\"50\" x2=\"40\" y2=\"74\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><line x1=\"65\" y1=\"55\" x2=\"65\" y2=\"69\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><line x1=\"90\" y1=\"55\" x2=\"90\" y2=\"69\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><line x1=\"115\" y1=\"55\" x2=\"115\" y2=\"69\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><line x1=\"140\" y1=\"55\" x2=\"140\" y2=\"69\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><line x1=\"165\" y1=\"55\" x2=\"165\" y2=\"69\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><line x1=\"190\" y1=\"55\" x2=\"190\" y2=\"69\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><line x1=\"215\" y1=\"55\" x2=\"215\" y2=\"69\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><line x1=\"240\" y1=\"55\" x2=\"240\" y2=\"69\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><line x1=\"265\" y1=\"55\" x2=\"265\" y2=\"69\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><line x1=\"290\" y1=\"50\" x2=\"290\" y2=\"74\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><line x1=\"315\" y1=\"55\" x2=\"315\" y2=\"69\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><line x1=\"340\" y1=\"55\" x2=\"340\" y2=\"69\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><line x1=\"365\" y1=\"55\" x2=\"365\" y2=\"69\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><line x1=\"390\" y1=\"55\" x2=\"390\" y2=\"69\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><line x1=\"415\" y1=\"55\" x2=\"415\" y2=\"69\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><line x1=\"440\" y1=\"55\" x2=\"440\" y2=\"69\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><line x1=\"465\" y1=\"55\" x2=\"465\" y2=\"69\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><line x1=\"490\" y1=\"55\" x2=\"490\" y2=\"69\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><line x1=\"515\" y1=\"55\" x2=\"515\" y2=\"69\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><line x1=\"540\" y1=\"50\" x2=\"540\" y2=\"74\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"40\" y=\"94\" font-size=\"15\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\" font-weight=\"bold\">0</text><text x=\"540\" y=\"94\" font-size=\"15\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\" font-weight=\"bold\">1</text><circle cx=\"40\" cy=\"62\" r=\"6\" fill=\"#dc2626\" stroke=\"#7f1d1d\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"40\" y=\"38\" font-size=\"16\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\" font-weight=\"bold\">K</text><circle cx=\"240\" cy=\"62\" r=\"6\" fill=\"#dc2626\" stroke=\"#7f1d1d\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"240\" y=\"38\" font-size=\"16\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\" font-weight=\"bold\">L</text><circle cx=\"340\" cy=\"62\" r=\"6\" fill=\"#dc2626\" stroke=\"#7f1d1d\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"340\" y=\"38\" font-size=\"16\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\" font-weight=\"bold\">M</text><circle cx=\"415\" cy=\"62\" r=\"6\" fill=\"#dc2626\" stroke=\"#7f1d1d\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"415\" y=\"38\" font-size=\"16\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\" font-weight=\"bold\">N</text><circle cx=\"540\" cy=\"62\" r=\"6\" fill=\"#dc2626\" stroke=\"#7f1d1d\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"540\" y=\"38\" font-size=\"16\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\" font-weight=\"bold\">P</text></svg></div><p><b>I.</b> 1’den 20’ye kadar numaralandırılmış 20 özdeş karttan rastgele çekilen kartta asal sayı yazması<br><b>II.</b> Hileli olmayan bir zar atıldığında üst yüze 7’den küçük bir sayı gelmesi<br><b>III.</b> İçinde yalnızca kırmızı ve mavi bilyeler bulunan bir torbadan rastgele çekilen bilyenin yeşil olması<br><b>IV.</b> İçinde 2 kırmızı ve 6 mavi bilye bulunan bir torbaya 2 kırmızı bilye daha atıldıktan sonra torbadan rastgele çekilen bilyenin mavi olması</p><p><b>Yukarıdaki olayların olma olasılıkları doğru üzerinde gösterildiğinde olaylar ile noktaların eşleştirilmesi aşağıdakilerden hangisi olur?</b></p>",
