   "s": "<div class=\"sv\"><div class=\"sv-g\"><b>Verilen</b> <ul><li>Doğru 0–1 arası 20 eş aralık: K = 0, L = {{8|20}}, M = {{12|20}}, N = {{15|20}}, P = 1.</li></ul><b>İstenen</b><p>Olaylarla noktaların eşleştirilmesi.</p></div><ol class=\"sv-s\"><li><b>I. olay</b> 1–20 arasındaki asallar: 2, 3, 5, 7, 11, 13, 17, 19. <span class=\"sv-m\">{{8|20}} → L</span></li> <li><b>II. olay</b> Zarın tüm yüzleri 7’den küçük; kesin olay. <span class=\"sv-m\">P = 1 → P noktası</span></li> <li><b>III. olay</b> Torbada yeşil yok; imkânsız olay. <span class=\"sv-m\">P = 0 → K</span></li> <li><b>IV. olay</b> 2 kırmızı eklenince 4 kırmızı, 6 mavi, toplam 10. <span class=\"sv-m\">{{6|10}} = {{12|20}} → M</span></li></ol><figure class=\"sv-f\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 520 95\" width=\"520\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" font-family=\"sans-serif\"><line x1=\"30\" y1=\"55\" x2=\"490\" y2=\"55\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><line x1=\"30\" y1=\"50\" x2=\"30\" y2=\"60\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><text x=\"30\" y=\"77\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#1e293b\" text-anchor=\"middle\">0</text><line x1=\"53\" y1=\"50\" x2=\"53\" y2=\"60\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><line x1=\"76\" y1=\"50\" x2=\"76\" y2=\"60\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><line x1=\"99\" y1=\"50\" x2=\"99\" y2=\"60\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><line x1=\"122\" y1=\"50\" x2=\"122\" y2=\"60\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><line x1=\"145\" y1=\"50\" x2=\"145\" y2=\"60\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><line x1=\"168\" y1=\"50\" x2=\"168\" y2=\"60\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><line x1=\"191\" y1=\"50\" x2=\"191\" y2=\"60\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><line x1=\"214\" y1=\"50\" x2=\"214\" y2=\"60\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><text x=\"214\" y=\"77\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#1e293b\" text-anchor=\"middle\">8/20</text><line x1=\"237\" y1=\"50\" x2=\"237\" y2=\"60\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><line x1=\"260\" y1=\"50\" x2=\"260\" y2=\"60\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><line x1=\"283\" y1=\"50\" x2=\"283\" y2=\"60\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><line x1=\"306\" y1=\"50\" x2=\"306\" y2=\"60\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><text x=\"306\" y=\"77\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#1e293b\" text-anchor=\"middle\">12/20</text><line x1=\"329\" y1=\"50\" x2=\"329\" y2=\"60\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><line x1=\"352\" y1=\"50\" x2=\"352\" y2=\"60\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><line x1=\"375\" y1=\"50\" x2=\"375\" y2=\"60\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><text x=\"375\" y=\"77\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#1e293b\" text-anchor=\"middle\">15/20</text><line x1=\"398\" y1=\"50\" x2=\"398\" y2=\"60\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><line x1=\"421\" y1=\"50\" x2=\"421\" y2=\"60\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><line x1=\"444\" y1=\"50\" x2=\"444\" y2=\"60\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><line x1=\"467\" y1=\"50\" x2=\"467\" y2=\"60\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><line x1=\"490\" y1=\"50\" x2=\"490\" y2=\"60\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><text x=\"490\" y=\"77\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#1e293b\" text-anchor=\"middle\">1</text><circle cx=\"30\" cy=\"55\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#dc2626\" stroke=\"#dc2626\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"30\" y=\"43\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#dc2626\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">K</text><circle cx=\"214\" cy=\"55\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#0e7490\" stroke=\"#0e7490\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"214\" y=\"43\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#0e7490\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">L</text><circle cx=\"306\" cy=\"55\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#16a34a\" stroke=\"#16a34a\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"306\" y=\"43\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#16a34a\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">M</text><circle cx=\"375\" cy=\"55\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#7c3aed\" stroke=\"#7c3aed\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"375\" y=\"43\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#7c3aed\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">N</text><circle cx=\"490\" cy=\"55\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#dc2626\" stroke=\"#dc2626\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"490\" y=\"43\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#dc2626\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">P</text><text x=\"260\" y=\"18\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#1e293b\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Her aralık 1/20</text></svg><figcaption>Olasılık doğrusunda noktaların değerleri.</figcaption></figure><table class=\"sv-c\"><tr class=\"ok\"><td>A</td><td>I–L, II–P, III–K, IV–M ✓</td></tr><tr><td>B</td><td>I M değil, IV L değil</td></tr><tr><td>C</td><td>IV N değil</td></tr><tr><td>D</td><td>II ve III yer değiştirmiş</td></tr></table><div class=\"sv-t\"><b>Püf nokta:</b> Olasılık doğrusunda 0 imkânsız, 1 kesin olaydır.</div><div class=\"sv-w\"><b>Tuzak:</b> IV’te eklenen bilyeleri unutup {{6|8}} = {{15|20}} ile N’yi seçmek.</div><div class=\"sv-a\">Cevap <b>A</b></div></div>"
