   "a": "A",
   "s": "<div class=\"sv\"><div class=\"sv-g\"><b>Verilen</b> <ul><li>d doğrusu A(−1, 7) ve B(3, −1)’den geçiyor.</li> <li>10 kartta nokta koordinatları.</li></ul><b>İstenen</b><p>Noktanın d üzerinde olma olasılığı.</p></div><ol class=\"sv-s\"><li><b>Eğim</b> <span class=\"sv-m\">m = (−1 − 7) / (3 − (−1)) = −8 / 4 = −2</span></li> <li><b>Denklem</b> y = −2x + b; A noktasını yerine koy. <span class=\"sv-m\">7 = −2 · (−1) + b → b = 5 → y = −2x + 5</span></li> <li><b>Kartları dene</b> <span class=\"sv-m\">Üzerinde: (0, 5), (2, 1), (4, −3), (−2, 9), (6, −7), (−4, 13)</span> <span class=\"sv-m\">Değil: (1, 4), (5, −4), (−3, 10), (2, −1)</span></li> <li><b>Olasılık</b> <span class=\"sv-m\">P = {{6|10}} = {{3|5}}</span></li></ol><figure class=\"sv-f\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 520 300\" width=\"520\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" font-family=\"sans-serif\"><line x1=\"38\" y1=\"189\" x2=\"304.4\" y2=\"189\" stroke=\"#475569\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><line x1=\"146\" y1=\"7\" x2=\"146\" y2=\"293\" stroke=\"#475569\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><text x=\"312.4\" y=\"193\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#1e293b\" text-anchor=\"middle\">x</text><text x=\"154\" y=\"11\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#1e293b\" text-anchor=\"start\">y</text><line x1=\"40.4\" y1=\"9.6\" x2=\"302\" y2=\"293\" stroke=\"#dc2626\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"189.2\" y=\"98\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#dc2626\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-weight=\"bold\">y = −2x + 5</text><line x1=\"50\" y1=\"186\" x2=\"50\" y2=\"192\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"50\" y=\"205\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#1e293b\" text-anchor=\"middle\">−4</text><line x1=\"98\" y1=\"186\" x2=\"98\" y2=\"192\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"98\" y=\"205\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#1e293b\" text-anchor=\"middle\">−2</text><line x1=\"242\" y1=\"186\" x2=\"242\" y2=\"192\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"242\" y=\"205\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#1e293b\" text-anchor=\"middle\">4</text><line x1=\"290\" y1=\"186\" x2=\"290\" y2=\"192\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"290\" y=\"205\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#1e293b\" text-anchor=\"middle\">6</text><line x1=\"143\" y1=\"254\" x2=\"149\" y2=\"254\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"140\" y=\"258\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#1e293b\" text-anchor=\"end\">−5</text><line x1=\"143\" y1=\"124\" x2=\"149\" y2=\"124\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"140\" y=\"128\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#1e293b\" text-anchor=\"end\">5</text><line x1=\"143\" y1=\"59\" x2=\"149\" y2=\"59\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"140\" y=\"63\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#1e293b\" text-anchor=\"end\">10</text><circle cx=\"146\" cy=\"124\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#16a34a\" stroke=\"#16a34a\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><circle cx=\"194\" cy=\"176\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#16a34a\" stroke=\"#16a34a\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><circle cx=\"242\" cy=\"228\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#16a34a\" stroke=\"#16a34a\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><circle cx=\"98\" cy=\"72\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#16a34a\" stroke=\"#16a34a\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><circle cx=\"170\" cy=\"137\" r=\"5\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><circle cx=\"266\" cy=\"241\" r=\"5\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><circle cx=\"74\" cy=\"59\" r=\"5\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><circle cx=\"290\" cy=\"280\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#16a34a\" stroke=\"#16a34a\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><circle cx=\"194\" cy=\"202\" r=\"5\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><circle cx=\"50\" cy=\"20\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#16a34a\" stroke=\"#16a34a\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><circle cx=\"330\" cy=\"40\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#16a34a\" stroke=\"#16a34a\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"342\" y=\"45\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#1e293b\" text-anchor=\"start\">Doğru üzerinde (6)</text><circle cx=\"330\" cy=\"65\" r=\"5\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"342\" y=\"70\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#1e293b\" text-anchor=\"start\">Değil (4)</text></svg><figcaption>Yeşil noktalar d doğrusu üzerindedir.</figcaption></figure><div class=\"sv-t\"><b>Püf nokta:</b> Bir nokta doğru üzerindeyse koordinatları denklemi sağlar.</div><div class=\"sv-w\"><b>Tuzak:</b> Grafikte görünmeyen (6, −7) ve (−4, 13)’ü atlamak {{2|5}} verir.</div><div class=\"sv-a\">Cevap <b>A</b></div></div>"
