   "q": "<p><i>Bir olayın olma olasılığı = {{İstenilen olası durumların sayısı|Tüm olası durumların sayısı}}</i></p><p>Aşağıdaki 12 özdeş kartın her birinde, bir üçgenin kenar uzunlukları olabilecek üç sayı santimetre cinsinden yazılmıştır.</p><div class=\"fig\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 560 180\" width=\"560\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"On iki kart: 6 8 10; 5 12 13; 7 24 25; 8 15 17; 4 5 6; 9 12 16; kök 2 kök 3 kök 5; 2 3 kök 13; 10 24 25; 1 1 kök 3; 3 4 6; kök 5, 2 kök 5, 5.\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" font-family=\"Arial, sans-serif\"><rect x=\"10\" y=\"10\" width=\"122\" height=\"44\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#eef2ff\" stroke=\"#3730a3\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"71.0\" y=\"37.6\" font-size=\"16\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\" font-weight=\"bold\">6, 8, 10</text><rect x=\"145\" y=\"10\" width=\"122\" height=\"44\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#eef2ff\" stroke=\"#3730a3\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"206.0\" y=\"37.6\" font-size=\"16\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\" font-weight=\"bold\">5, 12, 13</text><rect x=\"280\" y=\"10\" width=\"122\" height=\"44\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#eef2ff\" stroke=\"#3730a3\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"341.0\" y=\"37.6\" font-size=\"16\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\" font-weight=\"bold\">7, 24, 25</text><rect x=\"415\" y=\"10\" width=\"122\" height=\"44\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#eef2ff\" stroke=\"#3730a3\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"476.0\" y=\"37.6\" font-size=\"16\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\" font-weight=\"bold\">8, 15, 17</text><rect x=\"10\" y=\"65\" width=\"122\" height=\"44\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#eef2ff\" stroke=\"#3730a3\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"71.0\" y=\"92.6\" font-size=\"16\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\" font-weight=\"bold\">4, 5, 6</text><rect x=\"145\" y=\"65\" width=\"122\" height=\"44\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#eef2ff\" stroke=\"#3730a3\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"206.0\" y=\"92.6\" font-size=\"16\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\" font-weight=\"bold\">9, 12, 16</text><rect x=\"280\" y=\"65\" width=\"122\" height=\"44\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#eef2ff\" stroke=\"#3730a3\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"341.0\" y=\"92.6\" font-size=\"16\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\" font-weight=\"bold\">√2, √3, √5</text><rect x=\"415\" y=\"65\" width=\"122\" height=\"44\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#eef2ff\" stroke=\"#3730a3\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"476.0\" y=\"92.6\" font-size=\"16\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\" font-weight=\"bold\">2, 3, √13</text><rect x=\"10\" y=\"120\" width=\"122\" height=\"44\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#eef2ff\" stroke=\"#3730a3\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"71.0\" y=\"147.6\" font-size=\"16\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\" font-weight=\"bold\">10, 24, 25</text><rect x=\"145\" y=\"120\" width=\"122\" height=\"44\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#eef2ff\" stroke=\"#3730a3\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"206.0\" y=\"147.6\" font-size=\"16\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\" font-weight=\"bold\">1, 1, √3</text><rect x=\"280\" y=\"120\" width=\"122\" height=\"44\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#eef2ff\" stroke=\"#3730a3\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"341.0\" y=\"147.6\" font-size=\"16\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\" font-weight=\"bold\">3, 4, 6</text><rect x=\"415\" y=\"120\" width=\"122\" height=\"44\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#eef2ff\" stroke=\"#3730a3\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"476.0\" y=\"147.6\" font-size=\"16\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\" font-weight=\"bold\">√5, 2√5, 5</text></svg></div><p>Kartlar bir torbaya atılıyor ve torbadan rastgele bir kart çekiliyor. Karttaki uzunluklarla bir üçgen çizilecektir.</p><p><b>Buna göre çizilecek üçgenin dik üçgen olma olasılığı kaçtır?</b></p>",
